Use the supplied reference images as visual direction: the cinematic Formula 1 homepage for the storefront and the clean, structured commerce layout for ticket purchasing.

The customer experience should have the visual polish of Ticketmaster's ticket marketplace, adapted into a dark Formula 1 environment.

Do not use a white-background default theme for the primary interface. Do not produce a generic SaaS dashboard for the public storefront.

