## 2.6 Reference fidelity

Recreate the overall quality and information hierarchy of a major ticket marketplace: searchable event discovery, structured listings, clearly separated ticket types, transparent pricing and a frictionless checkout.

Do not copy Ticketmaster's proprietary logo, source code, branded assets or exact protected page artwork. Build a distinctive Mastrotickets design using the same broad commerce conventions and the mandatory Formula 1 aesthetic.

